{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24369","headline":"春夜宴席上戏赠裴淄川 · 白居易","name":"春夜宴席上戏赠裴淄川","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九十不衰真地仙，六旬犹健亦天怜。\n今年相遇莺花月，此夜同欢歌酒筵。\n四座齐声和丝竹，两家随分鬬金钿。\n留君到晓无他意，图向君前作少年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}